WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.775
"I've heard enough!" shouted Toad.

2
00:00:19.776 --> 00:00:23.140
He grabbed Rat's walking stick.

3
00:00:23.141 --> 00:00:28.014
"I'm going to Toad Hall right now!" he said.

4
00:00:28.015 --> 00:00:31.548
"It's no good, Toad," said Rat.

5
00:00:31.549 --> 00:00:34.653
"The Wild-Wooders won't leave!

6
00:00:34.654 --> 00:00:37.157
Come sit down."

7
00:00:37.158 --> 00:00:42.877
But Toad was already out the door.

8
00:00:42.878 --> 00:00:46.400
Toad hurried down the path.

9
00:00:46.401 --> 00:00:50.476
"I'll get them out!" he shouted.

10
00:00:50.477 --> 00:00:52.956
"They have no right!"

11
00:00:52.957 --> 00:00:57.138
Toad stopped at the gate of Toad Hall.

12
00:00:57.139 --> 00:01:02.135
A ferret popped up from behind the gate.

13
00:01:02.136 --> 00:01:06.814
He pointed a long gun at Toad.

14
00:01:06.815 --> 00:01:13.938
"Who are you?" asked the ferret coldly.

15
00:01:13.939 --> 00:01:17.749
"Who am I?" yelled Toad.

16
00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:20.209
"I am Toad!

17
00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:23.216
Toad Hall is my house!"

18
00:01:23.217 --> 00:01:26.203
The ferret said nothing.

19
00:01:26.204 --> 00:01:29.021
He aimed his gun.

20
00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:34.211
"You can't point that at me!" shouted Toad.

21
00:01:34.212 --> 00:01:37.675
Bang! The ferret fired.

22
00:01:37.676 --> 00:01:41.549
The bullet whizzed by Toad's ear.

23
00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:44.254
"Hey!" cried Toad.

24
00:01:44.255 --> 00:01:47.007
"You almost hit me!"

25
00:01:47.008 --> 00:01:51.353
The ferret aimed the gun again.

26
00:01:51.354 --> 00:01:54.980
Toad threw himself on the ground.

27
00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:59.289
Bang! The bullet flew over his head.

28
00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:02.544
"I'm leaving!" yelled Toad.

29
00:02:02.545 --> 00:02:07.337
Toad stood up and ran down the road.

30
00:02:07.338 --> 00:02:12.937
"Look at the fat toad run!" shouted the ferret.

31
00:02:12.938 --> 00:02:16.138
Toad turned around.

32
00:02:16.139 --> 00:02:22.780
All the ferrets were laughing loudly.
